      <b data-is-speakable>Israel launches ground offensive in southern Lebanon</b>   <b data-is-speakable>The Israeli military has launched what it called a "limited, localized" ground offensive in southern Lebanon against the Iran-backed Lebanese militant group Hezbollah.</b>
